  <sys:String x:Key="Onboarding.Switch.Title">Connect your Switch</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Onboarding.Switch.Intro">Now connect your Switch. This is the only console step and is required only once.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Onboarding.Switch.Description">1. Put Moonlight-Switch on the SD card and open it on the Switch.&#x0a;2. Add this computer.&#x0a;3. When a PIN appears, confirm it in the Sunshine interface.&#x0a;4. Close Moonlight and connect the SD card to this computer.</sys:String>
